<p>For 4 turns many small saws circle around the target in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 4,</acronym> making any creature caught inside bleed for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">115, 154, 185, 211, 234</acronym> physical damage.</p><p>Damage increases with your steampower.</p>